OL,3,GNEWSARecord year for little tern
OL,4,Abreeding numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team behind a conservation project
OL,7,Fhave seen the birth of a record number
OL,8,Fof chicks of an endangered species.
OL,10,FAlmost 150 little tern chicks have
OL,11,Ffledged at Beacon Lagoons, near
OL,12,FEasington on the East Yorkshire coast,
OL,13,Faccording to the RSPB.
OL,15,FThe charity said this year had seen the
OL,16,Fhighest number of breeding pairs since
OL,17,Fthe site began operating 50 years ago `
OL,18,F116, up from 59 pairs just two years
OL,19,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
