OL,3,GNEWSARecord year for little tern
OL,4,Abreeding numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservation officer Mike Pilsworth
OL,7,Fsaid: "I've been involved in the
OL,8,Fproject for nearly 30 years and it's
OL,9,Famazing to see the population
OL,10,Fincreasing when there are so many
OL,11,Fspecies not doing well."
